SUMMARY:Leonardo's Last Supper: free entry
DESCRIPTION:Official rule: “Free admissions related to the first Sundays 
 of the month will be made available exclusively on the online sales platfo
 rm https://cenacolovinciano.vivaticket.it/ starting at 12 noon on the prev
 ious Wednesday morning. On some days admission is free or reduced for all:
  tickets are usually made available on the preceding Wednesday starting at
  12 noon. Advance reservations for entrance to the Last Supper Museum are 
 required at all times\, for everyone (even infants) and for all types of a
 dmissions (even free ones).”\nSource: https://cenacolovinciano.org/en/in
 fo/ (checked on 30 October 2026)\nDate calculated by Before You Fly from t
 he official rule. Rules can change: check the official page before you boo
 k.\nOfficial tickets: https://cenacolovinciano.vivaticket.it/\nhttps://bef
 ore-you-fly.netlify.app/ticket-release-dates/last-supper-milan/
URL:https://before-you-fly.netlify.app/ticket-release-dates/last-supper-mil
 an/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
